# Runahead prediction-contract corpus for Spyro 3 (fields: bk2 | vbl | depth).
# See games/spyro-1/corpus/runahead-corpus.manifest for the contract.
#
# sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry at 2285: the camera is bit-identical
# at 2285 and at 2289, so the whole 2N window is one view and every differing
# pixel is a latch rather than camera motion. The scene itself moves 9774
# pixels across those two ticks, which is the row's floor for reading the
# statistic. VBL 2073, which the presentation corpus pins, is not usable here:
# the camera pans ~70 units per tick there, and a led capture differs from the
# canonical one by 218351 pixels of which 128538 differ by less than 8 - a
# sub-pixel view offset that swamps the defect.
#
# Speculation on this movie is adopted into the real timeline at VBL 2500 (a
# level transition), so a row past that point would measure nothing.
sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2 | 2285 | 2
